      "mean_wrong_labels_conditional_on_event": 30,
      "conditional_fanout_rationale": "Measured complete-matrix withholding fanouts are 6 for WPP→AWPP, 34 for threshold/gap anchors, 39 for SPP→LWPP→WPP, and 45 for FewP→SPP. A model error can affect multiple anchors; some lost inference paths have independent easy mathematical justifications, so withholding is exposure rather than an error count. Thirty is a deliberately broad conditional mean.",
