      "conditional_fanout_rationale": "QMA→PP withholding loses 18 complete-matrix labels; removing the MA→QCMA and QCMA→QMA simulation anchors loses 45. A shared model mismatch could affect both. Conditional mean 35 allows broader propagation beyond the three in-scope QMA/PP inclusions.",
      "evidence": "The H/T/X/CNOT formulas, distinct CNOT wires, input/witness/ancilla indexing, pure witness normalization, total-language gap, and concrete unary-length circuit generator were inspected. Classical-witness dephasing is realizable by copying to unused ancillas. No arbitrary-amplitude gate or nonuniform generator is present.",
