      "evidence": "FFK/FFKL primary definitions and chains, OH counting closure results, KST lowness, STT closure, individual Zoo discovery records and the parent historical inclusion graph comparison yielded no missing unconditional counting edge. Finding many conditional rules does not establish an unconditional omission.",
